{{Documentation/Header}}
__notoc__
The '''UtaiteUnit''' template is used to display standardized information boxes for various types of utaite units, including groups, collaboration units, and duet units. It provides a consistent format for presenting basic information, social media links, and status of utaite-related groups.

== Utaite Groups ==
===Examples===
====Without Agency Parameter====
{{T|UtaiteUnit|Type=group
|Kanji= クレノア
|Romaji= Kurenoa
|English= CleeNoah
|Image= CleeNoah.png
|Years= 2021
|Status= {{Active|groups=true}}
|Sns=true
|Twitter=clee_noah
|YouTube=Clee_Noah
|YouTubedesc=Clee Noah Official YouTube Channel
|_Y_=1
|block=1
}}

====With Agency Parameter====
{{T|UtaiteUnit|Type=group
|Name=IRREGULAR DICE
|Image= MEMORIZE.png
|Years= 2020
|Status= {{Active|groups=true}}
|Agency= VOISING
|Fanname=いれりす
|Fanmark=🎲
|Sns=true
|Twitter=ireisu_info
|YouTube=ireisu
|YouTubedesc=IRREGULAR DICE Official YouTube Channel
|Line=oP9vSOb
|Tiktok=ireisu_info
|_Y_=1
|block=1
}}


====Disbanded Group====
{{T|UtaiteUnit|Type=group
|Name=Disbanded Group 1
|Image= Template doc.png
